+# Symbol graph grammars
+
+The MVP binary compiles the following tree-sitter grammars for the symbol graph.
+The language set follows the MVP design described in the repository README.
+
+| Language | Crate | File extensions |
+|---|---|---|
+| Rust | `tree-sitter-rust` | `.rs` |
+| TypeScript | `tree-sitter-typescript` | `.ts`, `.tsx` |
+| JavaScript | `tree-sitter-javascript` | `.js`, `.jsx` |
+| Python | `tree-sitter-python` | `.py` |
+| Go | `tree-sitter-go` | `.go` |
